/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
/_site/
# /docs/* (not /docs/) so the PDF exception below can actually apply —
# git can't re-include a file whose parent directory is itself ignored.
/docs/*
# ...except the rendered PDF, which is tracked so it's downloadable
# straight from the repo without a local Quarto build.
!/docs/Data-Science-for-High-School.pdf
/site_libs/
# PDF-render scratch artifacts (Mermaid-to-LaTeX intermediates), left
# next to source .qmd files rather than inside /docs/.
**/*_files/